video-watch editor mode (scripts/vw_editor.py, scripts/vw_whisper.py and the
editor-mode wiring in scripts/video_watch.py) is adapted from the `watch`
skill (claude-watch, https://github.com/taoufik123-collab/claude-watch).
Ported pieces: pacing metrics (pacing.py), the hook microscope (hook.py),
the report.md layout (report.py) and the Whisper client (whisper.py).
Claude-specific parts (allowed-tools frontmatter, slash command, hooks,
interactive prompts, hardcoded vault paths) were not carried over.

